</div></div></div></div></div><div class="screenmate-one__convenience"><div class="screenmate-one__convenience-wrap"><h2 class="heading " style="opacity:0">Built Around Everyday Convenience<div class="aurora"><div class="aurora__item"></div><div class="aurora__item"></div><div class="aurora__item"></div><div class="aurora__item"></div></div></h2><div class="screenmate-one__convenience-block dual-view-mode" aria-label=""><div class="screenmate-one__convenience-block-wrap container"><div class="screenmate-one__convenience-block-top"><h3 style="opacity:0" class="block-title">Dual View Mode</h3><div style="opacity:0" class="block-text">Place any two apps side by side, or keep the Tesla interface on one <br/>side and an app on the other. Resize and rearrange elements freely <br/>for a layout optimized for comfort, clarity, and ease of use.</div></div><div class="screenmate-one__convenience-block-video" style="opacity:0;background-image:url(file:///home/w/pro/teslogic_shopify_theme/_react/dist-ssr/ScreenmateOne/dual-view-mode-desktop-web.webp);background-size:cover;background-position:center"><video class="object-cover" style="opacity:0" loop="" muted="" fetchpriority="auto" playsInline="" playsinline="true" x5-playsinline="true" webkit-playsinline="true" aria-describedby="Two apps displayed side by side with Screenmate ONE Dual View" preload="none"><source type="video/mp4" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/b64205c13a1b4e46abf2d4c43ad94c40.mp4"/></video></div></div></div><div class="screenmate-one__convenience-block key-driving-info" aria-label="Screenmate ONE dashboard with speed, battery and blind spot information"><div class="screenmate-one__convenience-block-wrap container"><div class="screenmate-one__convenience-block-top"><h3 style="opacity:0" class="block-title">Key Driving Info</h3><div style="opacity:0" class="block-text">The Dashboard keeps vital information visible while <br/>you run apps, so you can check current speed, speed <br/>limit, blind-spot warnings, battery charge, and more.</div></div><div style="opacity:0" class="screenmate-one__convenience-block-pointer-wrap"><div class="icon screenmate-one__convenience-block-pointer top-left " style="top:calc(185 * 100vw / 1440);left:calc(259.5 * 100vw / 1440)"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20width=&#x27;357&#x27;%20height=&#x27;62&#x27;%20viewBox=&#x27;0%200%20357%2062&#x27;%20fill=&#x27;none&#x27;%20xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27;%3e%3cpath%20d=&#x27;M355%2060L314.421%2014.7836C306.834%206.32959%20296.011%201.50001%20284.651%201.50001L84.5%201.50003L1.5%201.50003&#x27;%20stroke=&#x27;white&#x27;%20stroke-opacity=&#x27;0.2&#x27;%20stroke-width=&#x27;3&#x27;%20stroke-linecap=&#x27;round&#x27;/%3e%3c/svg%3e" alt=""/></div><div class="screenmate-one__convenience-block-legend text-left" style="top:calc(156 * 100vw / 1440);left:0"><h4>Cruise &amp; Speed Limit</h4><span>Keep an eye on autopilot, <br/>cruise control, and speed limit</span></div></div><div style="opacity:0" class="screenmate-one__convenience-block-pointer-wrap"><div class="icon screenmate-one__convenience-block-pointer top-right " style="top:calc(185 * 100vw / 1440);right:calc(191.5 * 100vw / 1440)"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20width=&#x27;241&#x27;%20height=&#x27;64&#x27;%20viewBox=&#x27;0%200%20241%2064&#x27;%20fill=&#x27;none&#x27;%20xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27;%3e%3cpath%20d=&#x27;M1.5%2062.5L63.6274%2010.7626C70.8144%204.77742%2079.8716%201.50001%2089.2244%201.50001L145.5%201.5L239.5%201.50001&#x27;%20stroke=&#x27;white&#x27;%20stroke-opacity=&#x27;0.2&#x27;%20stroke-width=&#x27;3&#x27;%20stroke-linecap=&#x27;round&#x27;/%3e%3c/svg%3e" alt=""/></div><div class="screenmate-one__convenience-block-legend text-right" style="top:calc(156 * 100vw / 1440);right:0"><h4>Battery Status</h4><span>Monitor your Tesla&#x27;s <br/>battery status easily</span></div></div><div style="opacity:0" class="screenmate-one__convenience-block-pointer-wrap"><div class="icon screenmate-one__convenience-block-pointer bottom-left " style="top:calc(376 * 100vw / 1440);left:calc(182.25 * 100vw / 1440)"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20width=&#x27;212&#x27;%20height=&#x27;38&#x27;%20viewBox=&#x27;0%200%20212%2038&#x27;%20fill=&#x27;none&#x27;%20xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27;%3e%3cpath%20d=&#x27;M1.5%2036.0012L154.159%2036.0012C163.582%2036.0012%20172.703%2032.6744%20179.913%2026.6071L209.75%201.50001&#x27;%20stroke=&#x27;white&#x27;%20stroke-opacity=&#x27;0.2&#x27;%20stroke-width=&#x27;3&#x27;%20stroke-linecap=&#x27;round&#x27;/%3e%3c/svg%3e" alt=""/></div><div class="screenmate-one__convenience-block-legend text-left" style="top:calc(376 * 100vw / 1440);left:0"><h4>SI and Imperial</h4><span>Screenmate supports both SI <br/>and Imperial measurement systems</span></div></div><div style="opacity:0" class="screenmate-one__convenience-block-pointer-wrap"><div class="icon screenmate-one__convenience-block-pointer bottom-right " style="top:calc(371.5 * 100vw / 1440);right:calc(204 * 100vw / 1440)"><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20width=&#x27;180&#x27;%20height=&#x27;42&#x27;%20viewBox=&#x27;0%200%20180%2042&#x27;%20fill=&#x27;none&#x27;%20xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27;%3e%3cpath%20d=&#x27;M178%2040.5003L66.4362%2040.5003C57.7177%2040.5003%2049.2379%2037.6518%2042.2875%2032.3883L1.5%201.50001&#x27;%20stroke=&#x27;white&#x27;%20stroke-opacity=&#x27;0.2&#x27;%20stroke-width=&#x27;3&#x27;%20stroke-linecap=&#x27;round&#x27;/%3e%3c/svg%3e" alt=""/></div><div class="screenmate-one__convenience-block-legend text-right" style="top:calc(376 * 100vw / 1440);right:0"><h4>Blind Spot Alerts</h4><span>Stay aware of surrounding traffic <br/>with real-time blind spot alerts</span></div></div></div></div><div class="screenmate-one__convenience-block beyond-basic-control" aria-label=""><div class="screenmate-one__convenience-block-wrap container"><div class="screenmate-one__convenience-block-top"><h3 style="opacity:0" class="block-title">