v></div><div class="screenmate-one__integration"><div class="screenmate-one__integration-block familiar-interfaces"><h2 class="heading " style="opacity:0">Familiar Interfaces,<br/>Seamlessly Integrated<div class="aurora"><div class="aurora__item"></div><div class="aurora__item"></div><div class="aurora__item"></div><div class="aurora__item"></div></div></h2><div class="screenmate-one__integration-block-body"><div><h3 style="opacity:0" class="block-title">CarPlay &amp; Android Auto for Tesla</h3><div style="opacity:0" class="block-text">Quick access to the apps you rely on.<br/>Connect once and enjoy a familiar<br/>interface every time you drive.</div></div><div><div class="screenmate-one__integration-block-video" style="opacity:0;background-image:url(file:///home/w/pro/teslogic_shopify_theme/_react/dist-ssr/ScreenmateOne/car-play-and-android-auto-desktop-web.webp);background-size:cover;background-position:center"><video class="object-cover" style="opacity:0" loop="" muted="" fetchpriority="auto" playsInline="" playsinline="true" x5-playsinline="true" webkit-playsinline="true" aria-describedby="Apple CarPlay and Android Auto on a Tesla display" preload="none"><source type="video/mp4" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/ad373295e1414eb684d1887cd2d7b93a.mp4"/></video></div></div></div></div><div class="screenmate-one__integration-block bigger-entertainment"><h2 class="heading " style="opacity:0">A Bigger Entertainment<br/>Experience<div class="aurora"><div class="aurora__item"></div><div class="aurora__item"></div><div class="aurora__item"></div><div class="aurora__item"></div></div></h2><div class="screenmate-one__integration-block-body"><div><h3 style="opacity:0" class="block-title">Bring Console Gaming<br/>to Your Tesla</h3><div style="opacity:0" class="block-text">More ways to play, all on the screen you already have. <br/>Enjoy smooth Android gaming powered by Qualcomm, <br/>or connect a compatible console through USB-C Video In.</div></div><div><div class="screenmate-one__integration-block-info"><div style="opacity:0" class="screenmate-one__integration-block-info-sketch"><img src="{{ 'react-console-gaming-desktop-4nT7gy5p.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Gaming console connected through Screenmate ONE USB-C Video In"/></div><div class="screenmate-one__integration-block-info-items"><div style="opacity:0" class="screenmate-one__integration-block-info-item"><div>USB-C Video In</div><div>Connect compatible gaming consoles and external<br/>video devices through the USB-C Video Input.</div></div></div></div><div class="screenmate-one__integration-block-video" style="opacity:0;background-image:url(file:///home/w/pro/teslogic_shopify_theme/_react/dist-ssr/ScreenmateOne/connect-consoles-desktop-web.webp);background-size:cover;background-position:center"><video class="object-cover" style="opacity:0" loop="" muted="" fetchpriority="auto" playsInline="" playsinline="true" x5-playsinline="true" webkit-playsinline="true" aria-describedby="Gaming console connected through Screenmate ONE USB-C Video In" preload="none"><source type="video/mp4" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/5ce255ace5174691bec5915850a7f1a2.mp4"/></video></div></div></div></div></div><div class="screenmate-one__dash"><div style="opacity:0" class="screenmate-one__dash-body"><div class="screenmate-one__dash-body-info"><div class="screenmate-one__dash-body-info-texts"><div class="screenmate-one__dash-body-info-texts-heading"><div style="opacity:0" class="screenmate-one__dash-body-info-texts-heading-badge"><span>A Must-Have App for Tesla Model 3/Y Drivers</span></div><h2 style="opacity:0" class="screenmate-one__dash-body-info-texts-heading-title">A complete driver display setup</h2></div><div style="opacity:0" class="screenmate-one__dash-body-info-texts-description">Screenmate ONE comes with native support for <br/>Screenmate Dash. Turn your phone into a clean <br/>instrument cluster in your line of sight, with five <br/>customizable screens and quick switching using <